## 📊 Performance Optimization Checklist

### Image Optimization
- [ ] All PNGs < 100KB (use TinyPNG or ImageOptim)
- [ ] Use WebP format for large images (25-35% size reduction)
- [ ] VectorDrawables for all icons (automatic scaling)
- [ ] 9-patch for resizable backgrounds
- [ ] Lazy load large assets (backgrounds on demand)

### Animation Optimization
- [ ] Use standard duration times (150/300/500/800ms)
- [ ] Limit simultaneous animations to 2-3 max
- [ ] Disable animations on low-end devices (< 2GB RAM)
- [ ] Use `remember` for expensive calculations
- [ ] Profile with Android Profiler during development

### Audio Optimization
- [ ] SFX: 128kbps mono MP3 (< 50KB each)
- [ ] BGM: 192kbps stereo MP3 or OGG (< 1MB each)
- [ ] Use MediaPlayer.release() for proper cleanup
- [ ] Stop music during app pause (save battery)
- [ ] Test on device with low storage space

### APK Size
- [ ] Target APK: < 50MB (uncompressed)
- [ ] Enable R8/ProGuard in release build
- [ ] Remove unused dependencies
- [ ] Bundle assets by screen
- [ ] Use PlayCore for asset delivery (if Google Play published)

