## 🐛 Common Issues & Fixes

### Issue: Images appear blurry on high-density devices
**Solution**: Ensure you've provided assets for all densities (mdpi, hdpi, xhdpi, xxhdpi)

### Issue: Buttons not responding to taps
**Solution**: Check minimum touch target size (48×48dp) and modifier order

### Issue: Animations stutter on animation playback
**Solution**: Profile with Android Profiler, reduce simultaneous animations

### Issue: Audio files not playing
**Solution**: Verify file format (MP3), check permissions in manifest, test on device

### Issue: Text overflow in small screens
**Solution**: Use `maxLines`, `overflow = TextOverflow.Ellipsis`, test on 360dp devices

### Issue: Colors look different on different devices
**Solution**: Test on physical devices, not just emulator (color calibration varies)

