- Update colors annually (new Material Design releases)
- Refresh icons every 6-12 months (design trends)
- Review animations quarterly (performance optimization)
- Test on new Android versions when released

### Deprecation Handling
- Remove deprecated APIs within 1 major version
- Provide migration guide in release notes
- Test extensively before deprecating
- Give 3+ months notice for breaking changes

### Backwards Compatibility
- Support Android API 24+ (5.5% of devices)
- Use AndroidX libraries (automatic backports)
- Test on multiple API levels during development
- Provide fallbacks for newer APIs

